      "Skin biopsy showing reduced intraepidermal nerve fiber density"
    ],
    "imaging": [
      "Normal MRI of brain and spinal cord to exclude central causes"
    ],
    "genetic": [
      "No known genetic mutations in idiopathic cases; genetic testing to exclude hereditary SFN"
    ],
